 * 3. Attempt to search posts via /discussionBoard/posts PATCH endpoint, filtering by the title substring and exact category.
 * 4. Assert that all returned posts are 'active' or otherwise visible to guests, contain the searched keyword in their title, and the correct category.
 * 5. Assert pagination (limit/page) behaves as expected, and that hidden/deleted posts are not in the results.
