 *
 * Steps:
 * 1. Member creates a discussion post.
 * 2. Member reports the created post.
 * 3. Moderator resolves/closes the post report.
 * 4. Moderator deletes (soft-deletes) the post report.
 * 5. Verify the report's deleted_at field is set (soft-deleted).
 * 6. (Optionally) Verify exclusion of report from listings if such API exists.
