 *
 * This test verifies that a moderator account is able to search and retrieve discussion board posts of every workflow status, including 'active', 'hidden', 'flagged', 'deleted', and drafts. It exercises advanced search and filter capabilities, such as searching by category, specific status, author role (member, moderator, admin), partial text for title/body, and pagination logic. Posts belonging to all visibility statuses are asserted to be discoverable only by moderators and not regular members.
 *
 * Step-by-step process:
 * 1. Register and log in a moderator, collecting the issued JWT from each step.
