 *    - One with status 'hidden'
 *    - One with status 'deleted'
 *    - One with status 'flagged'
 * 3. Search all posts without filter: assert that ALL created posts are present.
 * 4. Search by each individual status (active, hidden, deleted, flagged) and assert only the corresponding post is matched.
 * 5. Search by author_moderator_id: assert only posts by the moderator appear.
 * 6. Search by partial title and partial body text, assert posts are discoverable.
 * 7. Search by category_id, assert categorization is respected.
 * 8. Confirm pagination: with page and limit params, total records and result split are verified.
