 * 1. Register a new discussion board member
 * 2. Log in as the member to obtain valid session
 * 3. Create a post (to serve as the parent for comments)
 * 4. Create a comment under the post
 * 5. Delete (soft-delete) the created comment
 * 6. Attempt to report a random non-existent comment ID — expect error
 * 7. Attempt to report the soft-deleted comment — expect error
