 *
 * Step-by-step process:
 * 1. Register a new admin to obtain authorization, using /auth/admin/register.
 * 2. Create a new post as the admin via /discussionBoard/admin/posts (must set title and body to meet validation rules).
 * 3. Perform a soft-delete of the post using /discussionBoard/admin/posts/{postId} DELETE (should succeed).
 * 4. Attempt another soft-delete on the same post (should fail), validating that an error is thrown indicating post is already deleted or not found.
 * 5. Use TestValidator.error to confirm proper error handling for the redundant delete operation.
 */
