/**
 * Test moderator post report search for empty result and restricted access
 *
 * This test verifies two scenarios:
 * 1. A moderator attempts to search for post abuse reports using filters that ensure no reports are found, and verifies that the paginated result contains an empty data array.
 * 2. An unauthorized user (a regular member) attempts to call the moderator postReports search endpoint and receives an error (access denied/unauthorized).
 *  
 * Business context:
 * - Moderator endpoints should only be accessible to privileged users (moderator/admin roles). Regular members should receive errors on any attempt to use moderator-specific endpoints.
