 * 3. Each result only exposes allowed summary fields (id, email, status, assigned_at, revoked_at) and no sensitive properties.
 * 4. Pagination metadata accurately reflects total records, limit, page, and total pages.
 * 5. Only admin accounts can successfully use this endpoint; non-admins (if possible) are denied.
 *
 * Steps:
